  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2606.02 Application for a Local Permit to Sell Permissible Fireworks.\n\n(a) Each applicant for a local permit to sell permissible fireworks shall obtain a permit application from each municipality in which the person intends to sell or market permissible fireworks.\n\n(b) Each applicant for a local permit to sell permissible fireworks shall submit the following on the permit application:\n\n(1) Seller’s name, address and date of birth;\n\n(2) Business name and address;\n\n(3) That only permissible fireworks will be sold or marketed; and\n\n(4) Location(s), address(es) and physical description of all storage areas, including a site plan.\n\nSource. #5752, eff 12-2-93; ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2600.html"
